# Two checks whose findings here are the test doing its job: a generator seeded with a
# constant, which is what makes a sweep reproducible, and an assignment operator written
# to mishandle self-assignment so a test can observe it.
#
# clang-tidy resolves its configuration from the translation unit's main source file, and
# every translation unit in this project is a test -- the library modules are interface
# targets with no sources of their own. So this file governs the library headers a test
# includes as well, and these two checks are off everywhere, not only under this directory.
# It stops being true the moment a translation unit outside this tree enters the compile
# database; until then, read it as project-wide.
---
InheritParentConfig: true
Checks: '-cert-msc51-cpp,
-bugprone-unhandled-self-assignment'
